From c76e3910d7ae8e8e12a0e1e6b1505d94be1dc491 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:24:58 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Accept event date typed as dd/mm/yyyy

The form field becomes a text input in dd/mm/yyyy. Event validates the
typed value with validDate('d/m/Y') and converts it to Y-m-d before
save binds it, so the not-in-the-past check on edit compares the
original and the new date in the same format. The edit form shows the
stored date as dd/mm/yyyy.
